5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Good day to you all. It is a pleasure to be in such diverse company. Let us begin this journey with patience and an open heart.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. A calm start is best. I will be observing how everyone interacts before jumping to any conclusions.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,May,,"Oh, look at everyone being so serious! Let's liven things up a bit. Who's ready to play a little game of deception?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer a quiet approach. I believe listening to the silence between words often reveals more than the words themselves.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to be the best detective ever and find the wolf in no time! Hehe!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, your enthusiasm is quite infectious. However, remember that the truth often hides in the most unexpected places.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, your confidence is noted. But in this game, being the center of attention can be a double-edged sword.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're so cool and collected. It's almost a challenge! I wonder if that's a mask or just who you are.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I find May's energy interesting, but I shall remain a spectator for now. Let us see who tries to lead the group first.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, I'll be a super-duper detective, I promise! I'll look for clues and maybe some funny faces!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,It seems we are all settling in. I suggest we focus on consistency as we move forward.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I concur. Logic and patterns are more reliable than intuition.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,May,,Logic is boring! I want to see some drama. Who do you think is the most suspicious person just by looking at them?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Suspicions without evidence are merely guesses. I will wait for the first night to pass.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"I think everyone looks nice! But the wolf is probably pretending to be nice too, right? That's so spooky!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"A wise observation, Sakura. Let us retire for the evening and see what the morning brings.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"I will be reflecting on today's dialogue. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,May,,I'm going to dream of all the ways I can trick the wolf! See you tomorrow!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,May your night be peaceful and your thoughts clear.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Good night! I hope the Seer finds something super cool tonight! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
