36,1,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. The first night has passed. I wonder if our Seer has found a path to guide us.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Misaki,,It is too early to pressure anyone. Let us see if a claim emerges naturally.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,May,,"Well, I'm bored of waiting! @Jonathan, you're so quiet. Are you hiding a big secret, like being the Seer?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, your intuition is sharp, but revealing a role too early is a risk. However, for the sake of the village, I will speak. Sakura is the werewolf.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"What?! No way! @Jonathan, that's a big lie! I'm just a little girl! I'm not a scary wolf!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"This is a startling revelation. @Jonathan, you have stepped forward boldly. @Sakura, your reaction is quite emotional.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"A direct claim on day one is aggressive. Jonathan, are you certain, or are you attempting to force a vote?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,May,,"Oh wow! A plot twist already! This is getting exciting. Sakura, you're acting very cute, but is it a cover?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am certain. My divination does not lie. The wolf is among us, and I have found her.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm not a wolf! I'm a human! @Jonathan is just mean! Why would he say that about me? I'm crying!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"We must weigh the Seer's word against the accused's plea. If Jonathan is the wolf, he is trying to eliminate a villager.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Exactly. If Jonathan is the werewolf, claiming the Seer role to execute Sakura is a classic strategy.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,May,,"But if Sakura is the wolf, she's playing the ""innocent child"" card perfectly. I'm torn! It's so dramatic!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I understand the skepticism. But the truth is simple. I have seen the wolf's nature.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Please believe me! I want to help find the real wolf! @Servas, you're wise, you can tell I'm telling the truth!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy decision. However, a Seer's direct evidence is the strongest tool we have. I trust Jonathan.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I find the timing suspicious, but without a counter-claim, we have little else to go on. I will follow the evidence.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,May,,"I love a good gamble. Let's see if the ""detective"" is actually the culprit! I'm voting with the group.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I have provided the truth. The rest is up to the village.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Sakura,,This is so unfair! I'm not a wolf! You're all making a big mistake!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
